## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to architect per-tenant, private data path while supporting burst workloads, with per-tenant model versions, canary rollouts, and drift monitoring in AWS ML services.

## Key Concepts
- SageMaker Multi-Model Endpoint
- PrivateLink data residency
- Per-tenant Model Registry tags
- Canary rollouts and tenant routing
- Drift detection with SageMaker Clarify

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo AWS SDK calls to register and route per-tenant models
const sm = new SageMaker({region: 'us-east-1'});
sm.registerModel({ModelName:'tenantA-v2', ...});
sm.createEndpoint({EndpointName:'multi-tenant-endpoint', ...});

// Lambda routing logic
exports.handler = async (event) => {
  const tenant = event.headers['x-tenant-id'];
  const modelName = `${tenant}-latest`;
  return await sm.invokeEndpoint({
    EndpointName: 'multi-tenant-endpoint',
    TargetModel: modelName,
    Body: JSON.stringify(event.body)
  });
};
```

## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical deployment choices that balance latency, cost, and data locality for beginners.

## Key Concepts
- SageMaker Endpoint configuration and quantization
- Auto-scaling by latency target
- Canary rollouts for low-risk deployment
- Data residency and basic validation

## Code Example
```javascript
// setup autoscaling (simplified)
import { ApplicationAutoScalingClient, RegisterScalableTargetCommand, PutScalingPolicyCommand } from '@aws-sdk/client-application-auto-scaling';
const c = new ApplicationAutoScalingClient({region: 'us-east-1'});
async function cfg(){
  await c.send(new RegisterScalableTarget({
    ServiceNamespace: 'sagemaker',
    ResourceId: 'endpoint/my-image-endpoint/variant/AllTraffic',
    ScalableDimension: 'sagemaker:variant:DesiredInstanceCount',
    MinCapacity: 1,
    MaxCapacity: 20
  }));
  await c.send(new PutScalingPolicy({
    PolicyName: 'LatencyTarget',
    PolicyType: 'TargetTrackingScaling',
    ServiceNamespace: 'sagemaker',
    ResourceId: 'endpoint/my-image-endpoint/variant/AllTraffic',
    ScalableDimension: 'sagemaker:variant:DesiredInstanceCount',
    TargetTrackingScalingPolicyConfiguration: {
      TargetValue: 200
    }
  }));
}
```

